scope one red found at the door, one class measured, 23 controls repaired at the edge and re-run green, one checkout's identity and signing restored, nine fixture files cleared
status GREEN on the repair -- 23 of 23 controls pass, refusal proven from both sides, identity and signing restored and agreeing with a peer tree. STOPPED at custody gate 5: the 12 pushed unsigned commits need a history rewrite and wait for Keaton's word.
recommend check in (Keaton) -- twelve commits on main are unsigned under a fixture identity; repairing them is a history rewrite, which is yours to call
